The PC port in this repository is based on ACGC-PC-Port
(https://github.com/flyngmt/ACGC-PC-Port), a native PC port of the
GameCube Animal Crossing decompilation.

- The decompilation code (src/, include/) is CC0 1.0 Universal, as stated in
  the repository's top-level LICENSE.

- The PC port layer (the pc/ directory) and the #ifdef TARGET_PC /
  PC_ENHANCEMENTS / KEYBOARD_TYPING additions to decompilation files are
  licensed under the MIT License below, except where a file states otherwise.

- pc/lib/fixnes is FixNES by FIX94, licensed under the MIT License (see
  pc/lib/fixnes/LICENSE).

- pc/lib/glad is generated by glad2 (SPDX: (WTFPL OR CC0-1.0) AND Apache-2.0).

- pc/src/ko and pc/tests (Korean input method and its tests) were written for
  this project and are licensed under the same MIT License terms.


